OL,3,ACoroner appeals to families linked to
OL,4,Ajailed surgeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner investigating the deaths of
OL,7,Fpeople treated by the jailed breast
OL,8,Fsurgeon Ian Paterson has appealed for
OL,9,F106 more patients' families to make
OL,10,Fcontact.
OL,12,FInquests are currently being heard into
OL,13,Fthe deaths of 70 women, to see if
OL,14,FPaterson's treatment or care caused an
OL,15,Funnatural death.
OL,17,FPaterson was jailed in 2017 after being
OL,18,Fconvicted of wounding patients by way
OL,19,Fof botched and unnecessary operations
OL,20,Fand given a 20-year prison sentence.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
