OL,3,ACoroner appeals to families linked to
OL,4,Ajailed surgeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquests' coroner, Judge Richard
OL,7,FFoster, said he was recently notified
OL,8,Fof the deaths of a further 106 patients
OL,9,Fwho were in their lifetime treated by
OL,10,FPaterson for breast cancer, but he said
OL,11,Fhe had not been told of their medical
OL,12,Fcause of death.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
